//// Future SCD Type 2 (NOT implemented in v1)
//// Preferred: dbt snapshots on a unit-attribute model, producing
////   valid_from / valid_to / is_current (dbt_valid_from, dbt_valid_to, …).
//// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
